WEBVTT

00:26:24.979 --> 00:26:31.887
on how work offices, for example,
could and should be organized.

00:26:31.911 --> 00:26:33.065
Talk about that.

00:26:33.089 --> 00:26:36.135
SC: Yeah, so, well, I told you,
before I started writing,

00:26:36.159 --> 00:26:37.545
I had been a lawyer, right?

00:26:37.569 --> 00:26:40.610
And at least back then,
it was the standard

00:26:40.634 --> 00:26:42.703
that lawyers had their own offices.

00:26:42.727 --> 00:26:46.523
So I had this lovely little space
looking out at the Statue of Liberty.

00:26:46.547 --> 00:26:50.455
And then I started writing,
ultimately, "Quiet,"

00:26:50.479 --> 00:26:55.118
and I went and I plopped myself
in Silicon Valley for a while

00:26:55.142 --> 00:26:56.668
while I was doing the research,

00:26:56.692 --> 00:26:58.914
because I figured this
is going to be the place

00:26:58.938 --> 00:27:01.011
that will be a nirvana for introverts,